    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nExceptional ground floor apartment located in the highly sought-after Priory Court Development of just 16 units.\n\nThe property comes to the market in great condition with accommodation comprising kitchen/dining, large living room with open fireplace and ample space for a separate dining area, 2 double bedrooms (master ensuite), and a bathroom.\n\nThe apartment benefits from gas central heating and private parking.\n\nA five-minute walk brings you to the main street and its many amenities as well as bus and rail links to Dublin and beyond.\nA great property in a great location. \n\nThe annual management fee is 900 p.a."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.27m x 1.2m\nWith coving.\n\nHotpress - \n\n\nHall - 4.27m x 1.05m\n\n\nKitchen / Dining Area - 3m x 2.9m\nWith generous waist and eye level storage and tiled splashbacks.\n\nLiving Room - 6m x 3.7m\nSpacious with ample room for living and dining areas, benefits from an open fireplace and double glass doors to the front.\n\nBathroom - 3m x 1.5m\nWith bath, w.c. w.h.b and part tiled walls.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3m x 3.05m\nDouble with fitted storage.\n\nBedroom 2 Ensuite - 4.26m x 3.86m\nWith fitted storage.\n\nEnsuite - \nFully tiled with mains shower, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\n"
      },
      {
